{"server":"cn","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_02_beg","groupId":"act43side","stageId":"act43side_02","title":"排演一出悲剧","storyCode":"AD-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act43side/level_act43side_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"bdeb8fe9b31d3e52927d9df6eea90a99d73ed3a3bebdd937a9b4f2d524829b84","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g2_setting_rooftop"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘记不幸遇害的兄长，跟我私奔吧，杜邦夫人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清醒一点，第二个洛克菲勒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也听到了那个信使说的，根本不存在什么“杜邦夫人”，什么高贵、优雅、知性......所有我身上你们所爱的东西都是无根的浮萍......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不配成为你们兄弟三人中任何一人的妻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我爱你，就算你不姓杜邦我也依然爱你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你的兄长，那个死掉的家伙一直在利用你，你被蒙在鼓里，你也是受害者，你又何苦为此自责？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在会客厅挤满了前来吊唁的宾客，虽然“杜邦”只是一个虚名，但于情于理我都不应该当着他们的面离开......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有方法能让我们现在就离开宅邸，从此再也不理睬家族纷争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这要如何做到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你忘记了？我是一名军人，亲爱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这座宅邸的杂物间搜集了材料，制作了这副钢索......抓紧吊缆，我们就能从这个露台，直接飞跃花园，抵达屋后的森林。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走吧，去一个不在乎财富和阶级的地方！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，军人先生，你的方法还是太野蛮了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"万一滑轮卡住，我们会悬停在半空中好几个小时，直到有人发现我们......或者绳索断裂直接坠入森林......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，装置非常安全。我不会让你受伤的，亲爱的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的吗，洛克菲勒？我、我觉得我要掉下去了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“有人掉下来了！快，快叫救护车！满地都是血......谢莉！你还愣在这里干什么！”\n脊背被寒意攫住，手指连动也不能动，神经也跟随绳索缓慢断裂的声音不断受到拉扯。\n“到底是怎么回事......”\n“所以，剧组的结论就是，她的死只是威亚自然老化造成的意外？就这样轻描淡写地解决了？这可是死了一个人！”\n不像......对......两起事故一点都不像。道尔顿死于刀下，而五年前的演员死于坠亡。\n咯吱。咯吱。不祥的断裂声再次响起。在哪儿？究竟在哪儿？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......谢莉，谢莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"发什么愣啊，快离开那里，货箱要砸下来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g3_filmset"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砸......砸下来？"},{"type":"narration","text":"谢莉僵在原地，呆板地抬头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她看着吊在空中的货箱离头顶越来越近，仿佛吊在空中的是自己，而她即将坠落。\n在货箱占据谢莉视野的下一秒，影子出现在她的身旁，一双有力的手握住她的胳膊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"谢莉感到一阵天旋地转，回过神时她已离开了原来的位置，安稳落在拍摄现场的另一边。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩......谢、谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以放手了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，对不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫伊拉，你是叫这个名字吧......可以放手了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......好。"},{"type":"narration","text":"谢莉这才看到，连接着货箱的绳索被小个子的道具师死死地拽在手上，她的手臂在颤抖，脸也憋得通红。\n直到卢西恩重复了一遍，她才慢慢地松开手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的神经太紧绷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫伊拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1831_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这是我作为道具组长的职责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这到底是怎么回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，我还想问你呢，怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些货箱确实是有年头了，需要重新检查一遍以防绳索再次松脱，但你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的是疯了，谢莉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫名其妙惊叫出声，打断了拍摄不说，连危险逼近了都不知道躲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工作人员","speakerId":"avg_npc_1847_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道是第一次看剧组拍威亚戏吗，吓成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......米兰妮和迈克尔的样子，让我想起了五年前那个坠落的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1834_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉，你先下去休息吧，别干扰剧组正常拍摄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（跳过道具箱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（贴近卢西恩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没、没什么，这个神秘的黑家伙刚刚在那边乱窜，我被吓到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对不起，请继续拍摄吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Miss.Christine","speakerId":"avg_4198_christ_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不满地甩动双尾）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g3_filmset"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是细看......谢莉长得也不差，就是总爱一惊一乍的，让人心里发毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚那场戏被打断真可惜，我的情绪正渐入佳境......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“渐入佳境”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迈克尔，你要感谢那位统筹小姐。要不是她中断拍摄，下一秒我就要骂出口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"台词、身形、情感......一无是处，整整两个月的拍摄，到现在你的表现甚至没有那位只演了一场戏的新人亮眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉过你，别把私生活的那一套带到拍摄里，现在看来，根本问题在于格蕾塔看走了眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她根本不该找只靠一对红耳朵就接到戏的偶像派担任主演，还一人分饰三角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您说得对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，怎么蔫头蔫脑的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平时这个时候，你早就开始用油腔滑调的语气为自己辩解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是想起可怜的老道尔顿了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有您资深，进组经验也不够丰富。被谢莉刚刚的意外一搅和，现在又有些心神不宁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"专业一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意外、失败、负面评价......要是会被这些小事影响到表演的状态，根本没办法在蓝卡坞待下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我的承受能力还欠锻炼，得向您多多请教......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说玛丽安娜女士凭一部二十八天拍成的影片包揽蓝卡坞电影节各类奖项时，您就在她的身后？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算颗粒无收，被报纸和记者冷嘲热讽，您还是照常回到剧组完成了当天的拍摄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我必须跟这样璀璨夺目的演员竞争，可能早就不拍戏了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......哦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，您误会了，我只是想了解您面对道尔顿的意外能保持镇定的秘诀，绝对没有别的意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"秘诀？没有什么秘诀，只是因为我并不熟悉道尔顿，也与那起事故毫无干系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反倒是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米兰妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1830_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你为他心神不宁那么久，难道他的死与你有关？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈克尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_1838_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道这一切真的只是巧合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道只是我疑心太重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道我真的该去看看心理医生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Miss.Christine不该成为你的借口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢莉小姐，Miss.Christine当时并没有出现在你所说的位置，更不会乱窜惊吓到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，代我向你的同伴说声抱歉吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你恐惧的究竟是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你应该问五年前剧组发生意外后，还有什么不令我恐惧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神写满了好奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以告诉你——其实本来也不是什么秘密，打听一下就能知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个发生意外的女孩，叫劳拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是一个初到蓝卡坞的新人演员，被格蕾塔女士招募进组，对自己的工作热情得过分，但完全不懂行业的规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道尔顿当时已经染上酒瘾，但风头仍盛。为了敲打一下不礼貌的后辈，他故意临时加戏，让小演员在威亚上吊了六七个小时。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到装置老化，绳索松脱......那名演员坠落身亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下一秒，血液从那名演员身下蔓延开，就像那天道尔顿的样子......"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢西恩看向谢莉的手臂，潜意识的不安教唆她对自己的身体行凶，血痕遍布。\n谢莉立即拉下挽在胳膊上的袖子，神色不安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会解决自己的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你低估了所谓的，“问题”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它会出现得越来越频繁，原本只是类似的声响才会引发幻觉，而现在哪怕只是拖动椅子，也会把你拉回那段过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你的关心，卢西恩“医生”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我脑中邪恶的小声响已经相处了五年，我了解它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能跟它们赛跑，在恐惧和非理性彻底占据我的大脑之前，尽可能多做些什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许道尔顿的死真是一个意外，但我需要摒除所有风险和威胁，避免五年前的事再次上演。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕那些威胁来自于剧组的发起者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还有别的顾虑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格蕾塔向我隐瞒了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们共用一个办公室，移动地块开出蓝卡坞主城区前，我在她桌上发现一份奇怪的文件，正想打开的时候被她拦下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谜题越来越多，而我跟那些相熟的成员分享着一段不堪的回忆，无法保持坦诚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还有恼人的声音和幻觉打断我的思绪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疼痛是一种缓解方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我说，“疼痛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它无法解决你的幻觉和癔症，但能为你提供喘息的机会，让你完成自己真正想做的事，解开未知的谜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些难以分辨真假的声音和影子会藏在细小的夹缝中，在你试图找回自我的时候阻止你，扰乱你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"疼痛是用来对抗它们的方法，只不过指甲的硬度可能不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"笔尖、刀锋......只要用力得当，任何锐利的人造物品都能为你提供帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舌头、手背、腿根......这些部位对疼痛更加敏感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......真是个奇怪的人，但你似乎很了解幻觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾经用这种方法让自己镇静？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底是什么人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_RL_castlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"疼痛是一种缓解方式。\n古怪的低语、可怕的景象......\n只是和谢莉不同，他需要解决的问题，并非对这些事物的恐惧，而是，渴望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩还没把源石唱片机还回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他估计也很着急吧，“白英花”不是说他最近焦虑得彻夜难眠吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"狂喜和狂悲都太表象了，他体会不到更复杂更极端的情感，自然也就没办法突破演技的瓶颈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但他还那么年轻，急什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩已经加入剧团六七年了吧，最开始那么被看好，拥有最动人的歌声，接受剧团长的亲自教导......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易拥有了主演的机会，现在排练却遇到了瓶颈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"剧团成员A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可他把那几张唱片听再多遍，也解决不了问题啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情感是演员的武器。那么第一步，你需要理解它们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师说，狂喜和狂悲都只是表象，形似的模仿只会让你丧失对更复杂情感的感知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是要怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绝望，真正的绝望会让你失去最珍视之物，同时为你打开一扇新的门......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将聆听一切你不曾聆听之低语，你将目睹一切你不曾目睹之景象，你将感悟一切你不曾感悟之情感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将成为，万物的明镜，戏剧本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像这样——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳咳——"},{"type":"narration","text":"卢西恩毁去了自己的歌喉。\n源石结晶在一瞬间灌入伤口，疼痛与绝望将他淹没。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"痛......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，别怕，我在这！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到底发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶哑的呜咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（变化的声线）原来......这就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，是你自己把自己弄成了这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得我之前的那次演出......或者说刺杀吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我失败了。他们说，我是个可悲的懦夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卢西恩，我已经不再是备受期待的艺术之子，我也不在乎那些孤立与嘲笑，因为我的心在那场演出后就已经不在剧团了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我还是留了下来......我们来自同个家乡，我们是......朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应过我，不会像他们那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1832_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师的话......是对的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉渊","speakerId":"avg_npc_1833_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我害怕......这座剧团，还有现在的你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"62_g7_mobileplotstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卢西恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1828_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，它会比你想象中更有效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1836_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我永远用不上你教授我的“小技巧”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
